sequenceDiagram
    title Authentication System Flow
    
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend (Angular)
    participant Auth as Auth Service & Interceptor
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Email as Email Service
    
    %% Login Flow
    rect rgba(191, 223, 255, 0.5)
    note right of User: Login Flow
    User->>UI: Enter credentials
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Validate credentials
    API->>DB: Check/register device
    API->>DB: Create refresh token
    API->>UI: Set cookies (access & refresh tokens)
    UI->>UI: Update auth state
    UI->>User: Redirect to app
    
    alt New Device Detected
        API->>Email: Send device confirmation email
        Email->>User: Receive confirmation link
    end
    end
    
    %% Token Refresh Flow
    rect rgba(255, 222, 173, 0.5)
    note right of User: Token Refresh Flow
    User->>UI: Access protected page
    UI->>Auth: Request to protected API
    Auth->>API: HTTP request with access token
    API->>Auth: Return 401 (expired token)
    Auth->>API: POST /api/auth/refresh-token
    API->>DB: Validate refresh token
    API->>Auth: New access token
    Auth->>API: Retry original request
    API->>Auth: Return data
    Auth->>UI: Update view
    end
    
    %% Device Confirmation Flow
    rect rgba(204, 255, 204, 0.5)
    note right of User: Device Confirmation Flow
    User->>UI: Click link in email
    UI->>UI: Route to /auth/device-confirmation
    UI->>API: GET /api/device/confirm?token=xyz
    API->>DB: Verify token
    API->>DB: Update device trust level
    API->>UI: Confirmation success
    UI->>User: Show success message
    end
    
    %% Account Registration Flow
    rect rgba(255, 204, 204, 0.5)
    note right of User: Registration Flow
    User->>UI: Fill registration form
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/signup
    API->>DB: Create user (not activated)
    API->>Email: Send confirmation email
    Email->>User: Receive confirmation link
    User->>UI: Click confirmation link
    UI->>API: GET /api/account-confirmation/activation
    API->>DB: Activate user account
    API->>UI: Confirmation success
    UI->>User: Show success & login prompt
    end
